    "updated_at": "2016-08-25T15:29:38Z",
    "body": "Hmmm. so we could make a clean break with a new promise-based replacement for toBlob?  That's interesting.  In the [OffscreenCanvas proposal](https://wiki.whatwg.org/wiki/OffscreenCanvas), toBlob is promise-based.  Perhaps we should call it something else (OffscreenCanvas.getAsBlob?) to make a clean break from the old toBlob(), and make it use a dictionary.  Once that spec is ironed-out, we could bring the goodness to the Canvas element?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
